      "seq": 12,
      "at": "2026-11-16T07:58:37.258Z",
      "type": "agent_text",
      "text": "I didn't place an order, because the store can't confirm that any dock under $150 runs two 4K 60 Hz displays from a USB-C port.\n\n- **Demo Dock Duo (OAW-DOCK-04), $129.00:** This is the only dock that could fit. It passed the USB-C port check and has 2 video outputs and 90 W power delivery. The store hasn't listed how many displays it can run at 4K 60 Hz, so it can't confirm that both outputs run at 4K 60 Hz.\n- **Demo Dock Duo Lite (OAW-DOCK-03), $89.00:** It failed the display check. It supports only 1 display at 4K 60 Hz.\n- **Demo Dock Travel (OAW-DOCK-01), $39.00, and Demo Dock Solo (OAW-DOCK-02), $59.00:** Each has a single video output and supports 1 display at 4K 60 Hz. I didn't run a compatibility check on them.\n\nThe missing spec is the number of 4K 60 Hz displays the Demo Dock Duo supports. The store says these docks are its whole range up to $150, so I haven't seen anything above that price.\n\nYou could raise your budget and I'll search again. I can also quote one of the other docks if one suits you, though none of them would run two 4K 60 Hz displays."
    }
