      "text": "I can't quote a dock for you, because none of the docks under $150 is confirmed to run two displays at 4K 60 Hz on a USB-C (DisplayPort Alt Mode) port. I didn't create a quote or an order.\n\n- **Demo Dock Duo (OAW-DOCK-04), $129.00:** The USB-C port check passed. The store hasn't filled in how many displays it can run at 4K 60 Hz, so I can't confirm it fits. It has 2 video outputs and 90 W power delivery, but that doesn't tell me whether both outputs can run at 4K 60 Hz.\n- **Demo Dock Duo Lite (OAW-DOCK-03), $89.00:** The USB-C port check passed, but it failed the display check. It supports only 1 display at 4K 60 Hz, and you need 2.\n- **Demo Dock Travel (OAW-DOCK-01, $39.00) and Demo Dock Solo (OAW-DOCK-02, $59.00):** Each has a single video output and supports 1 display at 4K 60 Hz. I didn't run the compatibility check on them, because their listed specs already show they can't drive two displays.\n\nIf you can raise the budget, I can search again. The store says this list is its whole range up to $150, so I haven't seen anything above that price. I can also quote one of the other docks if one of them suits you better.",
